[Trigger]
Name	arrival
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Master, Varn holds the crossing of the two great roads, and two keepers have come to take it before you. The heroes of the kingdom will not stop marching while any of you stands.
Action	objective	1	Destroy both rival keepers.
Action	objective	1	Hold the keep and your heart against the stream of heroes.
Action	objective	1	Claim your quarter, then take the lava-ringed fortress at the crossing.
Action	portal	1	off
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	quarterHeld
Mode	once
Cond	claimed	1	Quarter	25
Action	message	1	Your quarter is secure and your portal draws creatures again. A shrine of the old garrison opens to you, and the roads lie east and north.
Action	portal	1	on
Action	setflag	portalOn	1
Action	make	1	roomTemple
Action	reveal	1	SouthRoad
Action	reveal	1	WestRoad
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
